<title>BELGIUM: Belgium details new lira/franc ERM rates.</title>
<headline>Belgium details new lira/franc ERM rates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank gave the following new ERM bands for the lira on Monday, following the Italian currency's re-entry in the European Union's currency grid at the weekend.</p>
<p>The central rate is 20.8337 Belgian francs per 1,000 lira. The bilateral intervention rates are at 17.9417 francs (buy rate) and 24.1920 francs (sell rate).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
